:: VehVeh ChildrenHelp (Accept)

(metadata:
"title", "Offering to Help Veh-Veh",
"topicDetail", "She explains what you must do. It sounds simple enough."
)

$cssColumnParent[

$cssColumnChild[
	$cssBox[
    	($funcImage: (passage: "S: VehVeh atMarket")'s img)
         $cssBoxItem[''(print: (passage:)'s title )''<br>(print: (passage:)'s topicDetail)]
    ]
]

$cssColumnChild[

<!--VehVehLine short hand-->
(set: _line to (hook: "VehVehLine"))

<!--rial gain-->
(set: _rialGain to 10)

Veh-Veh undoes the sash around her waist and, upon having your permission, quickly ties it around yours. You are now bound to a chain of mewling apprentices, who are cheering at the changing of the guard.

<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
    "<!--A-->\"A bit tight...\"", "bitTight",
))
<br>


<!--bitTight-->
[
_line["Keep the sash on, and tug if any of them is straying or dragging their feet. It'll startle all of them, and they'll keep the culprit in line for you.
<br>
"You'll only need to take them around the Exchange. Show them how a citizen of Nurandah carry themselves. Be normal, I suppose.
<br>
"Any if they're being good, buy them a candied fruit or something. Here, have some of my pocket change."]
<br>
She hands you a few coins.
<br>
$cssDesc[You gain ''_rialGain` `(print: (passage: "item.rial")'s id)''.]

<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
    "<!--A-->\"Wow, gratitude, Veh-Veh.\"", "thanks",
))
<br>
](bitTight|



<!--thanks-->
[
_line["You all behave, understood? This is an esteemed guest from the //imperial heartlands//. Open your eyes and learn. Do not embarrass our school,"] she says loudly to the children. Half of them nod, the other half are already giggling, head swimming with schemes, must be. _line["I'll find you all when I'm done."]
<br>
And with that, Veh-Veh disappears into the crowd.

<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
    "<!--A-->You are left with the children.", "done",
))
<br>
](thanks|

<!--done-->
[
About a dozen pairs of gray-and-blue eyes are looking at you expectantly.
<br>
---

($funcQuestUpdateLink: "Time for some sightseeing!", "babysitMarket", "active", "You have agreed to watch over the junior apprentices for Veh-Veh while she does her other errands.", "All in a davehmar's duty.", [{
